<http://data.silknow.org/object/2c978e98-5e73-3a6f-b3e8-a037029995a9>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Ground: white satin. Design: on front and back cover, tree in the center, with border of flowers (roses, honeysuckle (?) and pansies). On back-binding four similar flowers. Worked with silk (greens, blues, yellows, pinks, and reds) and purl (gilded silver). Stitches: satin, couching, and French knots. Lined with yellow. Yellow silk pocket inside each cover. Cover and pockets stiffened with cardboard. Worn olive-green ribbon sewed to edge of back cover. Satin frayed at edges; lining edged."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/4bfb5458-6080-3cea-8585-86bb30f24a9c> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Ground: white satin. Design: on front and back cover, tree in the center, with border of flowers (roses, honeysuckle (?) and pansies). On back-binding four similar flowers. Worked with silk (greens, blues, yellows, pinks, and reds) and purl (gilded silver). Stitches: satin, couching, and French knots. Lined with yellow. Yellow silk pocket inside each cover. Cover and pockets stiffened with cardboard. Worn olive-green ribbon sewed to edge of back cover. Satin frayed at edges; lining edged."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/2c978e98-5e73-3a6f-b3e8-a037029995a9/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/2c978e98-5e73-3a6f-b3e8-a037029995a9/dimension/1> ;
